"Usage: iceoryx2_subscriber [OPTIONS] --local-authority <LOCAL_AUTHORITY> --peer-authority <PEER_AUTHORITY>\n\nOptions:\n      --iceoryx2-publisher-initial-max-slice-len <ICEORYX2_PUBLISHER_INITIAL_MAX_SLICE_LEN>\n          Complete encoded sample capacity, including metadata and alignment slack\n      --iceoryx2-publisher-allocation-strategy <ICEORYX2_PUBLISHER_ALLOCATION_STRATEGY>\n          Publisher strategy: static, best_fit or power_of_two\n      --iceoryx2-max-subscribers <ICEORYX2_MAX_SUBSCRIBERS>\n          Native subscriber ceiling per service; values above one enable fan-out\n      --iceoryx2-publisher-max-loaned-samples <ICEORYX2_PUBLISHER_MAX_LOANED_SAMPLES>\n          Maximum simultaneous native publisher TX loans\n      --route-family <MODE>\n          [default: owned-frame] [possible values: copy-minimized, owned-frame]\n      --encoding <WIRE_FORMAT>\n          [default: protobuf] [possible values: native, protobuf, xcdrv2, arrow, omgidl]\n      --local-authority <LOCAL_AUTHORITY>\n          \n      --peer-authority <PEER_AUTHORITY>\n          \n      --ue-id <UE_ID>\n          [default: 88992]\n      --ue-version-major <UE_VERSION_MAJOR>\n          [default: 1]\n      --topic-resource-id <TOPIC_RESOURCE_ID>\n          [default: 32769]\n      --method-resource-id <METHOD_RESOURCE_ID>\n          [default: 4096]\n      --payload <PAYLOAD>\n          [default: iceoryx2-subscriber]\n      --payload-alignment <PAYLOAD_ALIGNMENT>\n          [default: 1]\n      --send-count <SEND_COUNT>\n          [default: 1]\n      --send-interval-ms <SEND_INTERVAL_MS>\n          [default: 200]\n      --timeout-ms <TIMEOUT_MS>\n          [default: 5000]\n      --rpc-response-delay-ms <RPC_RESPONSE_DELAY_MS>\n          [default: 250]\n      --zenoh-config <ZENOH_CONFIG>\n          [default: ZENOH_CONFIG.json5]\n      --lola-mw-com-config-file <LOLA_MW_COM_CONFIG_FILE>\n          \n      --lola-rpc-response-mw-com-config-file <LOLA_RPC_RESPONSE_MW_COM_CONFIG_FILE>\n          \n      --lola-instance-specifier <LOLA_INSTANCE_SPECIFIER>\n          [default: /payload_flow]\n      --lola-rpc-response-instance-specifier <LOLA_RPC_RESPONSE_INSTANCE_SPECIFIER>\n          \n      --lola-service-type <LOLA_SERVICE_TYPE>\n          [default: payload_flow]\n      --lola-rpc-response-service-type <LOLA_RPC_RESPONSE_SERVICE_TYPE>\n          \n      --lola-event-name <LOLA_EVENT_NAME>\n          [default: payload]\n      --lola-rpc-response-event-name <LOLA_RPC_RESPONSE_EVENT_NAME>\n          \n      --lola-default-rx-channel <LOLA_DEFAULT_RX_CHANNEL>\n          [default: primary]\n      --lola-sample-size <LOLA_SAMPLE_SIZE>\n          [default: 4096]\n      --lola-sample-alignment <LOLA_SAMPLE_ALIGNMENT>\n          [default: 8]\n      --lola-max-samples <LOLA_MAX_SAMPLES>\n          [default: 16]\n  -h, --help\n          Print help\n"
